s="refresh">Last check: 24 Oct · 08:06 UTC</span></header>\n<main id="main"><div id="runtime-stale" class="notice error" role="status" hidden><strong>Snapshot expired or timestamp unverified.</strong> Current picks are withheld. The schedule is a target, not a guarantee. Check the <a class="" href="https://github.com/buffedlizard55-lab/MaltaProj4/actions">refresh workflow</a> and <a class="" href="sources.html">source status</a>.</div><noscript><div class="notice error"><strong>Live expiry checks require JavaScript.</strong> Treat all picks and percentages as dated observations, not current recommendations. Each line shows its observation and expiry; no automatic current-time check is possible with JavaScript off.</div></noscript><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Executive summary</p><h1>CS2 picks &amp; probabilities.</h1><p class="muted">Every open Hotspawn CS2 match, with our pick first and the supporting sources one tap away.</p></div><span class="date-pill">Sat, 24 Oct 2026</span></div><div class="fresh-strip live" id="freshness-strip"><span class="fresh-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="fresh-main"><strong>Last checked 24 Oct 2026 · 08:06 UTC</strong><span class="fresh-age" id="fresh-age"></span><span class="fresh-evidence"> · fixture evidence 24 Oct 2026 · 08:03 UTC</span><span class="fresh-schedule" data-slot-minutes="4,19,34,49"> · automatic re-check at :04, :19, :34 and :49 past each hour · <span id="next-slot">next slot 08:19 UTC</span></span></span><span class="fresh-next"><span class="fresh-next-label">Next pick</span><a class="fresh-next-link" href="evidence.html#match-1079659" data-next-lock="2026-10-24T10:54:00Z" data-next-expires="2026-10-24T10:54:00Z"><strong class="fresh-next-pick">Spirit Academy</strong><span class="numbers fresh-next-prob">64.5%</span></a><span class="fresh-next-when">24 Oct · 11:00 UTC</span></span><span class="fresh-counts"><span data-count="open">29</span> open CS2 match(es) · <strong><span data-count="picked">29</span> with a pick</strong> · <span data-count="priced">29</span> with a win probability · <span data-count="unresolved">0</span> unresolved</span><span class="fresh-links"><a class="fresh-cta" href="picks.html">View updated picks →</a><a class="" href="#picks-at-a-glance">Every pick on this page ↓</a><a class="" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved →</a></span><span class="fresh-state">Snapshot inside its 8-hour evidence window</span></div><section class="exec-bar" id="exec-summary" aria-label="Executive summary"><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary</p><p class="exec-bar-line"><span data-completeness>Every one of the 29 open matches has a pick, and every pick carries a win probability.</span></p><nav class="exec-bar-links" aria-label="Executive summary — where the updated picks are"><a class="button exec-bar-primary" href="picks.html">Updated picks →</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="#picks-at-a-glance">Every pick on this page ↓</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved &amp; limitations →</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="#unresolved-summary">Why a pick can be missing ↓</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="#unresolved-limits">Visible limitations ↓</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="matches.html">All matches →</a><a class="exec-bar-link" href="review.html">Flagged for review →</a></nav><p class="exec-bar-note">Probabilities come from external betting lines or our own labelled VRS model — never from Hotspawn. <span data-count="missing">0</span> open match(es) publish no percentage; every one is named with its reason in the <a class="" href="#unresolved-summary">unresolved section below</a> and on the <a class="" href="unresolved.html">unresolved page</a>. 63 of 92 feed rows are past their lock or start and stay unpriced on <a class="" href="matches.html">All matches</a>.</p><div class="exec-unresolved" id="exec-unresolved" aria-label="Unresolved picks and the limitations for generating them"><p class="exec-unresolved-head">Unresolved picks &amp; limitations</p><p class="exec-unresolved-count"><strong>0 unresolved picks</strong>: all 29 open match(es) carry a pick — 29 with a win probability and 0 research-only with no percentage.</p><ul class="exec-unresolved-limits"><li><strong>No two-sided line.</strong> A pick needs a price for the exact team pair and UTC start from an exchange or bookmaker. A fixture nobody lists stays blank, and a page that refuses this collector is recorded as a refusal — never filled in. <a class="" href="sources.html#method">Gates and sources</a></li><li><strong>Both teams must resolve for our own line.</strong> The <a class="" href="sources.html#model">Valve-standings model</a> prices a match only when both clubs map to Valve’s official standings with a current roster; with one side missing the row falls back to a sourced research pick and no percentage is published.</li><li><strong>Research needs exact identity.</strong> HLTV fixture, ranking, lineup and recent-form evidence only count for the exact opponent pair and start, or through the <a class="" href="sources.html#method">verified alias register</a>. A tie stays unresolved.</li><li><strong>Evidence expires.</strong> Every pick dies at the earliest of its eight-hour evidence window, the Hotspawn lock, the match start or the bookmaker cutoff, so a refresh that does not land leaves the board blank rather than stale. <a class="" href="review.html">Flagged for review</a></li></ul><p class="exec-unresolved-more"><a class="" href="#unresolved-summary">Every no-percentage row, with its sources ↓</a> · <a class="" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved &amp; limitations page →</a> · <a class="" href="#unresolved-limits">Why a pick can be missing ↓</a></p></div></section><nav class="exec-quicknav" id="exec-quicknav" aria-label="Executive summary — quick links"><p class="exec-quicknav-line"><strong>Executive summary</strong> · <span data-count="picked">29</span>/<span data-count="open">29</span> picks · <span data-count="missing">0</span> unresolved<span class="exec-quicknav-past"> · <span data-past-rows="63">63</span> past feed rows are not open</span>.</p><span class="exec-quicknav-actions"><a class="exec-quicknav-primary" href="picks.html">Updated picks →</a><a class="exec-quicknav-link" href="#unresolved-limits">Unresolved &amp; limits ↓</a></span></nav><details class="briefing-more"><summary>Site guide, navigation &amp; full briefing</summary><section class="panel exec-banner" id="exec-banner" aria-label="Executive summary — start here"><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary</p><h2>Where the updated picks are</h2><p>This site follows every CS2 match listed on Hotspawn for the current lobby — <strong>92 feed entries, <span data-count="open">29</span> open in this snapshot</strong>. <span data-count="picked">29</span> open matches have a pick; <span data-count="unresolved">0</span> are unresolved. <span data-count="priced">29</span> carry a win probability and <span data-count="researched">0</span> are research-only with no percentage. Hotspawn’s percentages are never used — probabilities come from external betting lines or from our own Valve-standings model, always with a source link.</p><p class="small">Of those 92 feed rows, 63 are past-dated records the endpoint still returns with <em>status: scheduled</em>. They are listed on <a class="" href="matches.html">All matches</a>, labelled as past fixtures, and never priced. <a class="" href="matches.html#feed-scope">What the feed returns →</a></p><div class="exec-banner-actions"><a class="button exec-primary" href="picks.html">Updated picks — all <span data-count="picked">29</span> →</a><a class="button secondary" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved &amp; limits (<span data-count="missing">0</span> without %) →</a><a class="button secondary" href="review.html">Flagged for review →</a><a class="button secondary" href="matches.html">All 92 matches →</a><a class="button secondary" href="sources.html#method">How we price →</a></div><p class="exec-banner-note">On a phone, the bottom bar has <strong>Home · Picks · Unresolved · Matches · Analysis</strong> — <strong>Picks</strong> is the full board. Tables become swipe-free cards.</p></section><nav class="exec-summary-links" aria-label="Executive summary — where to find the updated picks"><strong>Executive summary</strong> — this page lists every open match. For the focused board: <a class="" href="picks.html">Updated picks →</a> · <a class="" href="#picks-at-a-glance">All picks at a glance ↓</a> · <a class="" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved &amp; limitations →</a> · <a class="" href="matches.html">All 92 feed entries →</a><span class="exec-note">Every row below is one tap from its sources and calculation; the phone guide is in the summary above.</span></nav><nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Jump to a section of this page"><a class="" href="#picks-at-a-glance">All picks at a glance</a><a class="" href="#today">Today’s picks</a><a class="" href="#later">Later on the board</a><a class="" href="#unresolved-picks">Picks with no %</a><a class="" href="#unresolved-summary">Unresolved &amp; limitations</a><a class="" href="#unresolved-limits">Why a pick can be missing</a><a class="" href="#pick-limitations">Every rejected line</a><a class="" href="#coverage">Coverage</a></nav><section class="panel coverage-now" id="coverage-now" aria-label="Coverage right now"><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary · coverage right now</p><h2><span data-count="open">29</span> open CS2 matches. <span data-count="picked">29</span> picks. <span data-count="priced">29</span> with a win probability.</h2><p>At the recorded observation: <span data-completeness>Every one of the 29 open matches has a pick, and every pick carries a win probability.</span></p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="picks.html">View updated picks →</a><a class="button secondary" href="#picks-at-a-glance">Every pick on this page ↓</a><a class="button secondary" href="matches.html">All 92 matches →</a