res="2026-10-24T16:03:11.034642Z" data-evidence="2026-10-24T08:05:08.353667Z"><td class="team-col"><div class="teams">NEXVOID<span>vs</span>Alter Ego</div><div class="competition">DFRAG Invitational 2026 · B</div></td><td class="time-cell">26 Oct · 03:00<span class="small">UTC · locks 02:54</span></td><td><div class="probability"><div class="prob-team-labels"><span>NEXVOID</span><span>Alter Ego</span></div><div class="prob-pair"><span class="fav" aria-label="NEXVOID 57.5 percent">57.5%</span><span class="" aria-label="Alter Ego 42.5 percent">42.5%</span></div><div class="prob-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:57.5%"></i></div><div class="prob-label">LISTING-DERIVED ESTIMATE · 1.74 / 2.35</div><div class="model-line">VRS model: 68.2% / 31.8%</div></div></td><td class="pick-cell"><span class="pick">NEXVOID</span><span class="badge warning">Listing estimate</span></td><td class="source-links"><a class="" href="https://www.hotspawn.com/matches/nexvoid-vs-alter-ego-dfrag-invitational-2026-1082859">Hotspawn ↗</a><a class="" href="evidence.html#match-1082859">Evidence &amp; lines</a><a class="" href="https://api.bo3.gg/api/v1/matches?page[offset]=0&amp;page[limit]=100&amp;filter[matches.status][in]=upcoming&amp;filter[matches.discipline_id][eq]=1&amp;sort=start_date&amp;with=teams,tournament">Thunderpick (via BO3.gg API) ↗</a><span class="quote-time">Observed 24 Oct · 08:05 UTC<br>Expires 24 Oct · 16:03 UTC</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><section id="unresolved-summary"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary · evidence gaps</p><h2>Matches with no market line, and what was tried</h2><p>Rows above this section already carry a percentage: from a market where one exists, or from <strong>our own</strong> VRS model line where it does not. The rows here have a sourced pick and <strong>no percentage</strong>, or nothing supportable at all. Every rejected external line is shown with its numbers and the gate it failed. Blank means unverified, never 50/50.</p></div><a class="" href="unresolved.html">Full research queue →</a></div><div class="panel limitations" id="pick-limitations"><h3>Limitations for generating these picks</h3><ul class="checklist"><li><strong>No book lists the match.</strong> Low-tier and qualifier fixtures are often absent from Polymarket and Pinnacle, the two accessible line sources; Thunderpick and GG.BET gave this collector no validated automated quote, and access controls are not bypassed. <a class="" href="sources.html">Source status →</a></li><li><strong>A market exists but fails a gate.</strong> Stale updates, spreads wider than 25 points (60 in the labelled wide tier) or under $100 of liquidity are shown as rejected observations below, never published as a percentage.</li><li><strong>Names differ between sites.</strong> Odds move between sources only for an exact team pair and UTC start, or a label in the <a class="" href="sources.html#method">verified alias register</a>; a renamed or academy label that no primary source links stays unresolved rather than guessed.</li><li><strong>HLTV has no usable line.</strong> HLTV fixture pages confirm identity, lineups and rankings; their betting tables expose no independently confirmed numeric two-way line to this collector, and HLTV fan votes are never used.</li><li><strong>HLTV has a bracket slot but no team names.</strong> When HLTV publishes a TBA slot (as it did for benched gods vs TitanFlow on 22 October), the fixture page cannot confirm a roster. The two clubs\' own HLTV team pages are then read by exact label and used only to tell repeated Valve standings labels apart; the row is labelled research-only and carries <strong>no percentage</strong> if one side is missing from Valve\'s published standings.</li><li><strong>Our model needs both teams.</strong> The <a class="" href="sources.html#model">VRS model</a> prices a match only when both teams resolve in Valve’s official standings with their current rosters. With one side missing it degrades to a pick-only research tier, and with neither side resolvable the row stays unresolved with the attempts listed below.</li><li><strong>Timing.</strong> Every percentage expires at the earliest of its 8-hour evidence window, the Hotspawn lock, match start or bookmaker cutoff, so a pick can disappear before a match begins if its evidence ages out and no refresh lands.</li><li><strong>Some books post no line at all.</strong> On 21 Oct 2026 the Thunderpick affiliate rendering (bo3.gg) carried no two-way line for any DFRAG Invitational fixture or for benched gods vs TitanFlow while pricing control fixtures in the same events; Kalshi’s regulated CS2 series had zero open markets; GG.BET answered HTTP 403. Absence of a line is published as a limitation, never as 50/50. <a class="" href="review.html#2d0a85f2-no-line-dfrag">Flagged: DFRAG no-line</a> · <a class="" href="review.html#2d0a85f2-source-availability">Flagged: source availability</a></li><li><strong>Sources can disagree about the fixture itself.</strong> HLTV lists benched gods vs TitanFlow at a different instant than Hotspawn, EGamersWorld and bo3.gg, and the 22:00Z slot of CCT South America 2026 Series #7 is Zetta vs LOS NINOS on Hotspawn and HLTV but Alianza Lima Esports vs Los Niños on bo3.gg and Polymarket. Where labels or start times conflict, the conflicting price is withheld instead of being attached to the wrong match. <a class="" href="review.html#2d0a85f2-start-conflict-1081597">Flagged: start conflict</a> · <a class="" href="review.html#2d0a85f2-identity-conflict-1082837">Flagged: identity conflict</a></li></ul><p class="lim-now"><strong>At the recorded observation: Every open match currently carries a pick and a verified win probability.</strong> Non-market model lines and their limitations remain listed on the Unresolved &amp; non-market picks page.</p></div><details class="more gap-more"><summary>Show the 0 open match(es) with no market line — pick, method, every rejected source and the gate it failed</summary><div class="panel empty">No matches in this category at the last successful check. See All matches for the retained feed.</div></details><details class="more gap-more"><summary>Show which line sources were reachable, and what each one returned</summary></details></section><div class="freshness">Fixture observation: 24 Oct 2026 · 08:03 UTC · scheduled checks every 15 minutes at :04, :19, :34 and :49 UTC (GitHub may delay them), with a watchdog check every 10 minutes that dispatches the same verified pipeline when the published snapshot is over 90 minutes old · <a class="" href="sources.html">Refresh health ↗</a></div><div class="two-col"><section class="panel" id="how-picks"><p class="eyebrow muted">How picks are made</p><h2>Evidence before a favorite.</h2><ol class="method-steps"><li><div><strong>Find every Hotspawn CS2 fixture</strong><p>Compare the public lobby’s structured data with its own fixture feed.</p></div></li><li><div><strong>Price it from the market</strong><p>Validated exchange prices (Polymarket) or a bookmaker line (Pinnacle), normalized or de-margined.</p></div></li><li><div><strong>Originate our own line where no market exists</strong><p>Valve’s official standings points through Valve’s published formula and calibration, with HLTV lineups confirming each roster.</p></div></li><li><div><strong>Then research, never guess</strong><p>HLTV-verified identity and ranking order, or one-sided presence in Valve’s official standings, as a research-only pick with no percentage. Anything left stays unresolved.</p></div></li></ol><a class="" href="sources.html#method">Read the methodology →</a><a class="" href="analysis.html">TWC review &amp; contrarian screen →</a></section><section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow muted">Coverage notes</p><h2>What needs attention</h2><ul class="checklist"><li><span class="tick">↗</span>63 feed entries are not open by sourced timestamps.</li><li><span class="tick">↗</span>Missing series format is left blank, not inferred.</li><li><span class="tick">↗</span>Wide exchange spreads are flagged as low precision; model lines are labelled; research-only picks carry no percentage.</li><li><span class="tick">↗</span>Prices expire at the earliest source TTL, start, lock or bookmaker cutoff.</li></ul><a class="" href="review.html">Open Flagged for Review →</a></section></div></details></main>\n<nav class="mobile-tabs" aria-label="Phone navigation"><a href="index.html" aria-current="page"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg><span>Home</span></a><a href="picks.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L20 5"/><path d="M20 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"/></svg><span>Picks</span></a><a href="unresolved.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 9v5m0 3v.01M4.5 4.5h15v15h-15z"/></svg><span>Unresolved</span></a><a href="matches.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h14v17H5zM8 2v4m8-4v4M5 9h14M8 13h3m2 0h3m-8 4h3m2 0h3"/></svg><span>Matches</span></a><a href="analysis.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20V10m5 10V4m5 16v-7m5 7V7"/></svg><span>Analysis</span></a></nav>\n<footer><p>Independent research; not affiliated with Hotspawn or betting operators. Not betting advice. Market-implied probabilities are estimates, not guarantees. No bets or Hotspawn picks are placed by this site.</p><div><a class="" href="picks.html">Picks</a><a class="" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved</a><a class="" href="sources.html">Methodology</a><a class="" href="review.html">Flagged for review</a><a class="" href="data/latest.json">JSON data</a><a class="" href="data/matches.csv">CSV export</a><a class="" href="build-info.json">Build receipt</a><a class="" href="http